{"unit_id":"lhwu1__dsh-seelog#card-zh","repo":"lhwu1/dsh-seelog","commit":"170677912fae840adcc074c3543db424e39f3eb3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-seelog 是面向 DSH Web profile 的会话执行地图插件。它在会话视图栏注册“会话图”，由主机端只读路由读取 Session Log 并投影为轻量语义节点。图中按时间展示用户输入、模型回复、工具调用、轮次和失败，并把子 Agent 会话放到与主会话对齐的分支轨道。用户可拖动或滚动浏览执行过程，使用时间概览尺跳转，点击节点查看语义信息及原始事件上下文。适合需要梳理长会话、多 Agent 关系或定位具体日志事件的 DSH Web 用户；无需额外 API 密钥，数据来自 DSH 本地会话查询服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:11-15","src/host/web.ts:141-167","src/client/SessionMapView.tsx:87-98"]}
{"unit_id":"lhwu1__dsh-seelog#card-en","repo":"lhwu1/dsh-seelog","commit":"170677912fae840adcc074c3543db424e39f3eb3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-seelog adds a DSH Web session map. It turns logs into semantic nodes for messages, tools, and failures, with child sessions on aligned timeline branches. Pan or jump through events, then select a node to inspect details and nearby raw logs. It helps trace long sessions without an extra API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:11-15","src/host/web.ts:141-167","src/client/SessionMapView.tsx:87-98"]}
